<title>JAPAN: Odawara Engineering - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Odawara Engineering - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.44		vs	    4.31</p>
<p> Operating	  760    million    vs	  458    million</p>
<p> Current	    780    million    vs	  473    million</p>
